// Stiwi, hand-authored 256px portrait, painterly. The big planes began as the
// 128px portrait's shapes at double size; each feature was then re-checked
// against the photo at this size and painted further: dithered skin ramps,
// soft dithered edges on the hair, beard and background, dense hair and beard
// strands, iris rings, lid creases and lens sheen. Photograph used only by eye.
//
// Dithering uses one hidden `grain` mask, a 50% checkerboard drawn as diagonal
// one-pixel lines; a transition is a hand-drawn band with `except: ["grain"]`.
// Region maps are unordered, so every region carries its own unique z.
